From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 02:54:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] erofs: add signed dm-verity mapper foundation

Add signed root-hash activation, deterministic root-scoped mapper naming, keyed device lifecycle and validation, separate hash-device support, atomic sidecars, SELinux-safe fsconfig handling, shared-layer mount behavior, loop fallback protection, and mapper cleanup primitives on the Azure Linux v2.3.4 package baseline.

